252=State DC not available or state DC available but no COD

[Format=SEER other cause of death classification]
0=Alive or dead due to cancer
1=Dead (attributable to causes other than this cancer dx)
8=Dead (missing/unknown COD)
9=N/A not seq 0-59

[Format=Survival months flag]
0=Complete dates are available and there are 0 days of survival
1=Complete dates are available and there are more than 0 days of survival
2=Incomplete dates are available and there could be zero days of follow-up
3=Incomplete dates are available and there cannot be zero days of follow-up
8=Not calculated because a Death Certificate Only or Autopsy Only case

[Format=Total number of in situ/malignant tumors for patient]
0-58=* 00-58

[Format=Total number of benign/borderline tumors for patient]
0-27=* 00-27

[Format=Marital status at diagnosis]
1=Single (never married)
2=Married (including common law)
3=Separated
4=Divorced
5=Widowed
6=Unmarried or Domestic Partner
9=Unknown

